{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve or Die is the co-op multiplayer version of Arrow a Row. Team up with your friends, choose upgrades, and fight waves of different Kuns\u2014only together can you defeat Lao Da.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes it better than <i>Arrow a Row</i>?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can invite your friends to play together in co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons and builds for endless fun. The weapon system is much richer than <i>Arrow a Row</i>, featuring over a dozen unique options: a revolver that fires six powerful shots at once, a double-barrel shotgun with short range but massive damage, and a Gatling gun with insane fire rate that requires preheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent meta-upgrades outside of matches. After each run, you can improve your stats to make sure everyone can eventually clear the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694400?t=1759072189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694400?t=1759072189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694400/20a853da1310d3dd6cafdb705951bcdbff30b72e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759072189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694400/20a853da1310d3dd6cafdb705951bcdbff30b72e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759072189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve or Die is the co-op multiplayer version of Arrow a Row. Team up with your friends, choose upgrades, and fight waves of different Kuns\u2014only together can you defeat Lao Da.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p 